Z||000000||HummelHund||07-30-2001||12:42 AM||||I'm almost done with the mechanical restoration of my '84 SE, and am toying around with the idea of getting it painted a different color (it's white). What do y'all think about British Racing Green? Paint the Fiero BRG and get a tan interior from a junker to give it that Triumph TR7 look. Maybe a couple gold pinstripes down the sides? Has anyone painted their Fiero green? I've got a picture in my mind and I think it would look cool.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Sean W.<BR>'84 SE 2M4 WS6, The "Buzz Bomb". (restoration project to become daily driver)<BR>'84 Sport Coupe, The "Black Wedge of Death" ($150 running car)||||reg||5
