Z||000008||HummelHund||07-30-2001||04:20 PM||||That's cool, a guy I know has a green TR8 convertible with tan interior. He used to be on this forum, Wade87GT, I don't know if he still is. It's got sort of the same shape as a Fiero, that's sort of what I'm going for, the TR Triumph look. I always thought those were great looking cars, no matter what the TR6 people say. Of course I think Porsche 914s look good too, so my taste in cars has often been questioned.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Sean W.<BR>'84 SE 2M4 WS6, The "Buzz Bomb". (restoration project to become daily driver)<BR>'84 Sport Coupe, The "Black Wedge of Death" ($150 running car)||||reg||1
